{"seq":2,"slug":"document-chunking-rag-pipeline","title":"版面感知的文档 RAG：切分策略、检索召回与引用溯源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/document-vlm-rag-eval-operations/document-chunking-rag-pipeline","wordCount":2681,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"版面感知的文档-rag-切分策略-检索召回与引用溯源\">版面感知的文档 RAG：切分策略、检索召回与引用溯源</h1><p>跨境合规团队上传了一份 96 页的欧盟电池法规符合性报告，问「第 4.2 节规定的碳足迹申报截止日期是哪天」。版面解析已经把每一页切成标题、段落、表格和脚注，但难题从这一刻才开始：<strong>把哪些 token 放进同一个检索单元</strong>、<strong>用哪种相似度把它捞回来</strong>、以及<strong>回答里那句「根据第 4.2 节」到底对不对得上原文</strong>。三者依次是切分（chunking）、召回（retrieval）与引用溯源（attribution）。\n本文属于「文档大模型、文档 RAG 与评测运营治理」章节，承接上游已产出的版面结构：表格结构如何还原成带 <code>rowspan</code>/<code>colspan</code> 的网格见同 hub <a href=\"../layout-table-form-extraction/table-structure-recognition-extraction\"><code>2_table-structure-recognition-extraction.md</code></a>，骨干数据模型见 <a href=\"../document-ai-pipeline-document-model/document-layout-representation-model\"><code>2_document-layout-representation-model.md</code></a>。本节不重复那些转换，只回答「切完怎么用」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把三个环节的输入输出钉死。<strong>切分</strong>的输入是版面树（带类型标签的元素序列，每个元素知道自己属于哪个标题小节、哪一页、哪张表），输出是<strong>证据单元（chunk）</strong>——一段自带元数据的文本。<strong>召回</strong>的输入是查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 与 chunk 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\{c_1,\\dots,c_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，输出是 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 子集。<strong>引用溯源</strong>的输入是答案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 及其引用的 chunk，输出是论断与出处的支持关系判定。</p>\n<p><strong>切分不是「预处理」，而是检索质量的一等公民</strong>。Anthropic 的 contextual retrieval 实验给出的数字很直白：仅给每个块补一段「这段在整篇里讲什么」的上下文，检索失败率就从 5.7% 降到 3.7%（降 35%）；叠加上下文化 BM25 后降到 2.9%（降 49%）；再加重排降到 1.9%（降 67%），成本约<strong>每百万文档 token 一次性 $1.02</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/contextual-retrieval\">Anthropic, Contextual Retrieval</a>）。切分粒度、上下文注入和重排是三个可分别计量的杠杆。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[版面树: 标题/段落/表格/脚注] --&gt; B{切分策略}&#10;    B --&gt;|结构边界| C[结构感知 chunk]&#10;    B --&gt;|父子层级| D[小 chunk + 父节点引用]&#10;    C --&gt; E[上下文注入]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[嵌入编码]&#10;    F --&gt; G[稠密向量检索]&#10;    F --&gt; H[稀疏 BM25 检索]&#10;    G --&gt; I[融合 + 重排 top-k]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[生成带引用答案]&#10;    J --&gt; K[引用溯源校验]&#10;    K --&gt;|不达标, 重切| B&#10;    K --&gt;|达标| L[上线 + 评测运营]\">graph TD\n    A[版面树: 标题/段落/表格/脚注] --&gt; B{切分策略}\n    B --&gt;|结构边界| C[结构感知 chunk]\n    B --&gt;|父子层级| D[小 chunk + 父节点引用]\n    C --&gt; E[上下文注入]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[嵌入编码]\n    F --&gt; G[稠密向量检索]\n    F --&gt; H[稀疏 BM25 检索]\n    G --&gt; I[融合 + 重排 top-k]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[生成带引用答案]\n    J --&gt; K[引用溯源校验]\n    K --&gt;|不达标, 重切| B\n    K --&gt;|达标| L[上线 + 评测运营]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>核心决策</th>\n<th>典型失败模式</th>\n<th>可计量指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>切分</td>\n<td>按结构边界还是固定窗口</td>\n<td>表格被拦腰切断、标题与正文分离</td>\n<td>chunk 内聚度、表头重复率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文注入</td>\n<td>是否给块补全局语境</td>\n<td>代词指代悬空（&quot;该条款&quot;指哪条）</td>\n<td>检索失败率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回</td>\n<td>稠密/稀疏/后期交互如何融合</td>\n<td>长文档中段信息被淹没</td>\n<td>Recall@k、nDCG@k</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用溯源</td>\n<td>论断与出处是否真支持</td>\n<td>引用编号张冠李戴</td>\n<td>citation precision / recall</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"版面感知切分-结构边界优于窗口边界\">版面感知切分：结构边界优于窗口边界</h2><p>固定窗口切分（每 512 token 一刀）在纯文本文档上便宜够用，但在版面文档上会系统性切坏<strong>表格</strong>和<strong>跨页论述</strong>。表格被切断后，第二半块失去表头，模型看到「48.5, 1200, 螺钉」根本不知道列是什么——这正是 Docling 的 <code>HybridChunker</code> 默认 <code>repeat_table_header=True</code> 的原因：一张表跨多个 chunk 时，<strong>每个 chunk 都重复携带表头</strong>；同实现的 <code>merge_peers</code>（默认 <code>True</code>）则合并「标题相同但都太短」的相邻碎块，避免碎片污染索引（<a href=\"https://docling-project.github.io/docling/concepts/chunking/\">Docling, Chunking</a>）。</p>\n<p>结构感知切分<strong>沿着版面树已有的边界切</strong>：标题是天然分段点，列表项是原子单元，表格是一整个语义块。后果是 chunk 不再是「等长文本」而是<strong>带元数据的证据单元</strong>，至少含来源页码、所属标题路径、元素类型——Docling 的 <code>HierarchicalChunker</code> 正是直接用 <code>DoclingDocument</code> 结构产出 chunk 并挂上标题与题注。层级切分把它推到极致：LlamaIndex 的 <code>HierarchicalNodeParser.from_defaults(chunk_sizes=[2048, 512, 128])</code> 一次产出三层节点，每个子节点<strong>引用其父节点</strong>，配合 <code>AutoMergingRetriever</code> 在命中足够多同父兄弟块时用父块替换（<a href=\"https://developers.llamaindex.ai/python/framework/module_guides/loading/node_parsers/modules/\">LlamaIndex, Node Parsers</a>）。</p>\n<p>那语义切分（用相邻句子的嵌入相似度决定断点）值不值？2024 年的对照研究给出的答案是<strong>收益不稳定、成本明显</strong>：在文档检索、证据检索和检索式问答三类任务上，其额外计算「并未被一致的性能提升所证明」（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.13070\">Qu, Tu, Bao, 2024, arXiv:2410.13070</a>）。结论是<strong>当文档自带版面结构时先用结构边界，语义切分留作纯文本的退路</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检索召回-稠密-稀疏与后期交互的融合\">检索召回：稠密、稀疏与后期交互的融合</h2><p>切分决定「候选集的品质上限」，召回决定「能不能捞到」。三种机制各有盲区，2026 年的主流是多路融合：<strong>稠密检索（dense）<strong>编码 chunk 与查询取相似度，对同义改写鲁棒，却对</strong>精确 token</strong>（法规编号、货号、SKU）不敏感——&quot;Regulation (EU) 2023/1542&quot; 的向量可能和编号相近的另一部法规难以区分；**稀疏检索（BM25）**靠词频逆文档频率，精确关键词极准但不理解改写，上节把失败率从 3.7% 再压到 2.9% 正说明它补的正是稠密通道漏掉的精确匹配；<strong>后期交互（late interaction）<strong>保留每个 token 的向量做 token 级最大相似度求和，代表是 ColPali——直接把</strong>页面图像</strong>编码成多向量表示，跳过 OCR 和版面解析。</p>\n<p>ColPali 在自建 ViDoRe 视觉文档检索基准上报告平均 nDCG@5 <strong>81.3</strong>，而当时最强的传统管线（Unstructured 版面解析 + 图像描述 + BGE-M3）是 <strong>67.0</strong>，相差 14.3 个点；相比朴素 SigLIP 基线（51.4）提升 <strong>+22.5</strong>。分任务看，表格类 TabFQuAD 达 83.9、图表类 InfographicVQA 达 81.8（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01449\">Faysse et al., ICLR 2025, arXiv:2407.01449</a>）。这引出架构判断：<strong>文档以复杂版面为主（票据、报表、扫描件）时，端到端视觉检索可能优于「先解析再检索」的流水线</strong>；但以长文本论述为主（合同、法规）时，结构感知切分加混合检索仍是主流，因为视觉检索无法直接给出可引用的文本片段。排序指标可写成：给定查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 与二值相关标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rel}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>nDCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{nDCG@}k = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{2^{\\text{rel}_i}-1}{\\log_2(i+1)}}{\\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{2^{\\text{rel}^*_i}-1}{\\log_2(i+1)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nDCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.4976em;vertical-align:-1.5336em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.964em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1125em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1125em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2341em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2659em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0264em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0264em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5538em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7754em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1488em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9696em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5107em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5311em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3425em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1125em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.0336em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1125em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0429em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2341em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2659em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5311em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5336em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>融合之后的**重排（rerank）**是最后一道闸：先用便宜的双塔召回 20–50 个候选，再用交叉编码器精排。Anthropic 的 67% 降幅是在 top-20 上算的，与不加重排的 49% 相差 18 个百分点——<strong>重排是投入产出比最高的一环</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引用溯源-让每个论断有出处\">引用溯源：让每个论断有出处</h2><p>检索到了正确的块，不等于答案引用了正确的块。这个环节的基准是 ALCE——「首个面向 LLM 引用质量的自动评测基准」，它把引用质量拆成两个维度（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.14627\">Gao et al., EMNLP 2023, arXiv:2305.14627</a>）：<strong>citation recall</strong>（答案的每个论断是否至少有一个被引来源真正支持它）与 <strong>citation precision</strong>（被引的每个来源是否都真的支持所挂论断）。ALCE 报告的基线相当刺眼：即便最好的模型，在 ELI5 上也有 <strong>50% 的时间缺乏完整引用支持</strong>。这不是模型能力问题而是<strong>架构问题</strong>——检索阶段没把支撑论断的那块捞回来，生成阶段怎么引用都会失败。所以第一条工程原则是：<strong>把 citation recall 当作召回指标的延伸来优化，而不是生成后处理</strong>。</p>\n<p>实现有三层。<strong>块级出处绑定</strong>：每个 chunk 从切分起就携带 <code>doc_id + page + bbox</code>，生成时只允许引用被检索进上下文的 chunk id，输出的引用编号在后处理映射回元数据——这依赖上游版面表示保留坐标，见 <a href=\"../document-ai-pipeline-document-model/document-layout-representation-model\"><code>2_document-layout-representation-model.md</code></a>。<strong>「中间迷失」防护</strong>：Liu 等人的 TACL 论文证明模型在相关信息位于上下文<strong>开头或结尾</strong>时表现最好，放在中间会显著下降，连长上下文专用模型也不例外（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172\">arXiv:2307.03172</a>），因此最相关的块应放在上下文两端而非按分数线性铺开。<strong>引用校验闭环</strong>：生成后用轻量 NLI 判定「该 chunk 是否蕴含该论断」，不蕴含就剥离引用或触发重检索；ChunkRAG 更进一步，在生成前用 LLM 给每个 chunk 打相关性分并丢弃弱块，论文称这能「显著减少幻觉并提升事实准确性」（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.19572\">Singh et al., 2024, arXiv:2410.19572</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评测运营-把故障定位到层\">评测运营：把故障定位到层</h2><p>文档 RAG 的评测若只报一个「准确率」，故障就没法定位。Ragas 把指标拆成两层（<a href=\"https://docs.ragas.io/en/stable/concepts/metrics/available_metrics/\">Ragas, Available Metrics</a>）：<strong>检索层</strong>有 context precision（检索内容是否相关且排序合理）、context recall（参考答案所需信息有多少被捞回）、context entities recall（关键实体是否出现）；<strong>生成层</strong>有 faithfulness（答案的每个主张是否被上下文支持，即幻觉检测）、response relevancy（答案是否真的回应问题）。拆分价值在于<strong>归因</strong>：context recall 低而 faithfulness 高，说明检索漏了、模型没编；反之则说明检索够了、模型在编。两种故障的修复动作完全不同。</p>\n<p>长文档场景还要选对基准。MMLongBench-Doc 用 130 份长 PDF、平均 49.4 页，构造 1,062 道专家标注问题，其中 <strong>33.2% 需要跨页</strong>、<strong>22.8% 故意不可回答</strong>以探测幻觉；当期最好成绩是 GPT-4o 的 F1 <strong>42.7%</strong>，而「其余 12 个被测模型甚至不如使用有损 OCR 结果的纯文本 LLM 基线」（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01523\">arXiv:2407.01523</a>）。跨页占比高这一点尤其关键：它逼迫切分策略支持<strong>跨页证据合并</strong>，否则 33.2% 的题目连参与评分资格都没有。运营上建议把评测绑到每次切分或嵌入变更上——<strong>切分策略一改，历史基线全部失效</strong>，此时唯一能定位回归的就是同基准 A/B 对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>切分是检索质量的一等公民</strong>：版面文档优先按结构边界切（标题、表格、列表），固定窗口只是无结构文本的退路；语义切分的额外成本未被稳定收益证明（arXiv:2410.13070）。</li>\n<li><strong>上下文注入与重排是高杠杆</strong>：补块级语境降失败率 35%，叠加上下文 BM25 降 49%，再加重排降 67%，成本约 $1.02/百万 token（Anthropic）。</li>\n<li><strong>表格跨块必须重复表头</strong>：Docling <code>HybridChunker</code> 默认 <code>repeat_table_header=True</code>、<code>merge_peers=True</code>；层级切分（<code>chunk_sizes=[2048, 512, 128]</code>）配合自动合并实现检索时动态选粒度。</li>\n<li><strong>三路召回互补</strong>：稠密管改写、稀疏管精确编号、后期交互（ColPali 在 ViDoRe 平均 nDCG@5 81.3 vs 传统管线 67.0）管复杂版面；重排 ROI 最高。</li>\n<li><strong>引用溯源拆成 precision/recall</strong>（ALCE），把 citation recall 当召回指标的延伸来优化；注意「中间迷失」，把最相关证据放在上下文两端。</li>\n<li><strong>评测分层归因</strong>：context recall/precision 查检索、faithfulness 查幻觉（Ragas）；长文档用 MMLongBench-Doc 这类含跨页与不可回答问题集的基准，每次切分变更都要重跑基线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版面感知的文档 RAG：切分策略、检索召回与引用溯源","id":"版面感知的文档-rag-切分策略-检索召回与引用溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"版面感知切分：结构边界优于窗口边界","id":"版面感知切分-结构边界优于窗口边界"},{"level":2,"text":"检索召回：稠密、稀疏与后期交互的融合","id":"检索召回-稠密-稀疏与后期交互的融合"},{"level":2,"text":"引用溯源：让每个论断有出处","id":"引用溯源-让每个论断有出处"},{"level":2,"text":"评测运营：把故障定位到层","id":"评测运营-把故障定位到层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文档大模型：多模态理解范式、能力边界与提示工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/document-vlm-rag-eval-operations/document-vlm-multimodal-understanding"},"next":{"title":"文档智能评测与治理运营：幻觉控制、评测集建设与数据合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/document-ai-ocr-layout-table-extraction-engineering/document-vlm-rag-eval-operations/document-ai-evaluation-governance-ops"}}